# Python

- SPDX header: `Copyright 2026 Guzino (https://github.com/guzino)` and `SPDX-License-Identifier: Apache-2.0`
- Python 3.10+; pydantic v2 for domain models
- Domain must not import `adapters` or `application`
- Application must not import `adapters`
- Prefer ports over passing a raw `stage=` string through the loop
- No secrets in source; live keys via env only
- Tests use the fixture LLM unless the user asked for a live provider
